      "stableId": "math2-2014-q04",
      "sourceYear": 2014,
      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "questionNumber": 4,
      "stem": "曲线 $\\left\\{ \\begin{array} { l l } { x = t ^ { 2 } + 7 , } \\\\ { y = t ^ { 2 } + 4 t + 1 } \\end{array} \\right.$ 上对应于 t = 1 的点处的曲率半径是· · · · · · · ·",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "value": "$\\frac { \\sqrt { 1 0 } } { 5 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "value": "$\\frac { \\sqrt { 1 0 } } { 1 0 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "value": "$1 0 { \\sqrt { 1 0 } }$"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "value": "$5 { \\sqrt { 1 0 } } .$"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应选(C)．由曲线的参数方程，可得\n\n$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm{d} x}{\\mathrm{d} t} = 2 t, \\frac {\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t} = 2 t + 4, \\Rightarrow \\frac {\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x} = \\frac {2 t + 4}{2 t} = 1 + \\frac {2}{t}, \\frac {\\mathrm{d} ^ {2} y}{\\mathrm{d} x ^ {2}} = \\frac {- \\frac {2}{t ^ {2}}}{2 t} = - \\frac {1}{t ^ {3}}.\n$$\n\n对应于 t = 1 的点处 $y ^ { \\prime } { = } 3 , y ^ { \\prime \\prime } { = } { - } 1$ ，所以\n\n$$\nK = \\frac {\\left| y ^ {\\prime \\prime} \\right|}{\\sqrt {(1 + (y ^ {\\prime}) ^ {2}) ^ {3}}} = \\frac {1}{1 0 \\sqrt {1 0}} \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad R = \\frac {1}{K} = 1 0 \\sqrt {1 0}.\n$$",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
