      "stableId": "math2-2014-q16",
      "sourceYear": 2014,
      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "solution",
      "questionNumber": 16,
      "stem": "（本题满分10分）\n\n已知函数 $y = y ( x )$ 满足微分方程 $x ^ { 2 } + y ^ { 2 } y ^ { \\prime } = 1 - y ^ { \\prime }$ ，且 $y ( 2 ) = 0$ ，求 $y ( x )$ 的极大值和极小值",
      "options": [],
      "answer": null,
      "answerStatus": "missing",
      "explanation": "解. 将微分方程分离变量得 $( 1 + y ^ { 2 } ) \\mathbf { d } y = ( 1 - x ^ { 2 } ) \\mathbf { d } x$ ，两边分别积分得通解为\n\n$$\n\\frac {1}{3} y ^ {3} + y = x - \\frac {1}{3} x ^ {3} + C.\n$$\n\n由 $y ( 2 ) = 0$ 得 $C = { \\frac { 2 } { 3 } } ;$ ， 即\n\n$$\n\\frac {1}{3} y ^ {3} + y = x - \\frac {1}{3} x ^ {3} + \\frac {2}{3}.\n$$\n\n令 ${ \\frac { \\mathrm { d } y } { \\mathrm { d } x } } = { \\frac { 1 - x ^ { 2 } } { 1 + y ^ { 2 } } } = 0$ ，得 $x = \\pm 1$ ，且有\n\n$$\n{\\frac {\\mathrm{d} ^ {2} y}{\\mathrm{d} x ^ {2}}} = {\\frac {- 2 x (1 + y ^ {2}) ^ {2} - 2 y (1 - x ^ {2}) ^ {2}}{(1 + y ^ {2}) ^ {3}}}.\n$$\n\n当 $x = 1$ 时，可解得 y = 1， $y ^ { \\prime \\prime } { = } { - } 1 < 0$ ，函数取得极大值 $y = 1$ ；当 $x = - 1$ 时，可解得 $y = 0 , y ^ { \\prime \\prime } { = } 2 > 0$ ，函数取得极小值 $y = 0$",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "reviewStatus": "needs_human_review",
      "finalizationStatus": "blocked",
      "knowledgePoints": [],
      "anomalies": [],
      "sourceEvidence": [
