      "subjectCode": "math2",
      "type": "solution",
      "questionNumber": 17,
      "stem": "（本题满分 10 分）\n\n设平面区域 $D = \\bigl \\{ ( x , y ) \\bigl | 1 \\leqslant x ^ { 2 } + y ^ { 2 } \\leqslant 4 , x \\geqslant 0 . y \\geqslant 0 \\bigr \\}$ ．计算\n\n$$\n\\iint_ {D} \\frac {x \\sin (\\pi \\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}})}{x + y} d x d y.\n$$",
      "options": [],
      "answer": null,
      "answerStatus": "missing",
      "explanation": "解. 积分区域关于直线 y =x 对称，所以\n\n$$\n\\iint_ {D} \\frac {x \\sin (\\pi \\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}})}{x + y} d x d y = \\iint_ {D} \\frac {y \\sin (\\pi \\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}})}{x + y} d x d y.\n$$\n\n从而所求积分\n\n$$\nI = \\iint_ {D} \\frac {x \\sin (\\pi \\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}})}{x + y} \\mathrm{d} x \\mathrm{d} y = \\frac {1}{2} \\iint_ {D} \\frac {(x + y) \\sin (\\pi \\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}})}{x + y} \\mathrm{d} x \\mathrm{d} y\n$$\n\n$$\n= \\frac {1}{2} \\iint_ {D} \\sin \\left(\\pi \\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}}\\right) d x d y = \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{2}} d \\theta \\int_ {1} ^ {2} r \\sin \\pi r d r = - \\frac {3}{4}.\n$$",
